        {
          "text": "Mũmanthei Yeova, inyw’onthe ala auu ma nthĩ, ala mũkwatĩte motw’ĩo make; manthai ũlũngalu, manthai ũuu: nokwĩthĩwa mũvithwa mũthenya wa ũthatu wa Yeova. ",
